## VetoResponse

VetoResponse is the JSON text response format, not a tool to invoke.
@if nativeCalls
Native tool calls use the provider's tool-call format directly, without a VetoResponse wrapper. VetoResponse has no `calls` field; do not repeat them in JSON or combine them with `guide` in the same response.
@endif
@if guide
@verbatim
To submit a guided program, return `{"guide":{"actions":[...]}}` matching the schema. Submit a guide or tool calls in a response, never both.
@endverbatim
@endif
@verbatim
For a final answer, return `{"message":"..."}` with any supported citations. Omit unused optional fields.
@endverbatim

